#   second operand when the first is NaN, and NaN when the second is);
# - the predicates have no public stdlib counterpart;
# - to_radians and the literal-exponent powi are Rust's exact operation order;
# - exp and atan2 are the polyfill forms, the same bits on every target (the native f64_exp and
#   f64_atan are x87 on x86_64); hypot is ganita's; sin_cos is the builtin pair.
# Class-C results are within K = 2 ulp of glibc on every target (port-parity.md §2).

